<title>PORTUGAL: Avge yld eases on Portugal one-yr bills. [CORRECTED 8:59 GMT]</title>
<headline>Avge yld eases on Portugal one-yr bills. [CORRECTED 8:59 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield eased to 5.5983 percent, from 5.8983 percent previously, at the Treasury's sale of 364-day bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The Treasury placed 30 billion escudos, double the 15 billion initially offered. The last such sale was on January 6.</p>
<p>(Corrects to make clear rate eased 0.3 percentage points).</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
